WEBVTT

00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:15,820
I am taking the Michael pole and the biotoxin binder, as you suggested, the instructions

00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:22,220
for your office said to take it about half hour away from food in the afternoon. How far away

00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:29,420
from supplements should I take it? Since it has charcoal in it too. You're probably a better off

00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:37,500
keeping it at least an hour away from supplements. And it would be better if you kept it an hour

00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:44,780
away from food. So you just have to be reasonable. But if you can find that time, you know, I have

00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:49,740
some patients that were like, they won't eat, you know, two hours before they go to bed and then

00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:53,820
they'll take these right before they go to bed. That's something doable too. You've got to find

00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:59,340
what's doable in your life. Some people it's more difficult because they're working full time and

00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:03,740
it's trying to find a time to take different things and they have to kind of figure it out from themselves.

00:01:04,380 --> 00:01:11,420
It's best if you could take those two supplements, any binders, it'd be best if you could take it

00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:17,820
an hour away from food or supplements on either side. But then you're that's a two hour window

00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:27,100
that you're not eating if you're able to tolerate that.

